    details: ["All-Day Comfort, Built to Perform: Made with a High Quality cotton blend, these socks are ultra-soft, breathable, and designed for all-day wear. Perfect for Cricket, running, walking, or casual everyday use.", "Anti-Slip & Supportive Fit: Elasticated arch support and anti-slip design provide a secure grip and prevent sliding or bunching during intense workouts, keeping your focus where it should be \u2014 on performance.", "Breathable & Moisture-Wicking: Stay fresh and dry with mesh ventilation panels that allow airflow and wick away sweat, making these socks ideal for training, running, and sports in all seasons.", "Durable & Skin-Friendly: Reinforced heel and toe add durability, while the smooth seams prevent irritation \u2014 great for sensitive skin and long-lasting comfort.", "All Season Wear:  Lightweight yet durable design, perfect for year-round use. Ideal for Outdoor and sport like -cricket training sessions, match days, travel, and daily casual wear."],
