    colors: ["Olive"],
    sizes: ["L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Elevate your casual wardrobe with the playR Men's Lifestyle Adult Crew Jogger Track Pant. Designed for comfort and versatility, these track pants are perfect for any season. FLEXVENT with high-quality polyester, they provide a regular fit that effortlessly combines style and functionality. Whether you're heading to the gym, running errands, or lounging at home, these joggers are your go-to choice for a relaxed yet fashionable look.",
    details: ["Engineered with FLEXVENT and Micro-Fiber Comfort: These joggers are crafted using FLEXVENT design principles and ultra-soft micro-fiber threads that promote dynamic airflow and enhanced stretch, ensuring maximum freedom of movement whether you're hitting the gym or lounging. The combination of High micro-fibers and durable polyester offers a luxurious feel against the skin while maintaining high tensile strength for long-lasting use.", "Sweat-Release & Moisture-Wicking Fabric for Ultimate Dryness: Featuring advanced Sweat-Release and moisture-wicking, these joggers actively pull sweat away from the body and dry rapidly, keeping you cool and dry throughout intense workouts or during long commutes. The quick-dry polyester blend enhances ventilation and prevents discomfort caused by dampness or odor buildup.", "Highly Breathable & Skin-Friendly for All-Day Comfort: Designed to prioritize breathability, the joggers use skin-friendly, anti-static material that reduces friction and irritation. Whether you're running errands or engaging in outdoor activities, the breathable mesh-like weave ensures consistent airflow and optimal body temperature regulation even in warm weather conditions.", "Supportive Regular Fit with Adjustable : Styled in a regular fit that strikes the perfect balance between relaxed and structured, these joggers adapt to your natural shape without clinging or sagging. support and personalized fit, allowing unrestricted movement during sports or daily wear.", "Easy-Care, Anti-Static Performance Wear for Versatile Use: These joggers are made to perform and endure. The anti-static finish reduces static cling while making them easy to maintain \u2014 just toss them in the wash and they retain their shape, texture, and color. Suitable for jogging, training, yoga, or lounging, their quick-dry versatility makes them an essential addition to any activewear wardrobe."],
