    colors: ["Dark Grey"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Elevate your running and training wardrobe with the playR Men Adult Running Essential Lowers \u2014 designed to deliver the perfect combination of comfort, flexibility, and all-weather performance. Featuring cutting-edge FLEXVENT, these joggers actively wick away moisture, keeping you cool and dry through even the most demanding workouts.\nThe  fabrics ensure unmatched mobility and all-day comfort, making these lowers your reliable go-to for everything from intense running sessions to relaxed weekend outings. With a regular fit and adjustable waistband, they offer a secure, personalized fit that moves with you.",
    details: ["Advanced FLEXVENT Moisture Management:\nStay dry, fresh, and focused throughout your runs and training sessions. This high-performance fabric actively pulls sweat away from your skin and promotes rapid evaporation, keeping you cool and comfortable even during intense workouts or long-distance runs.", "Dry-Fit Stretch & Dry-Tech Fabric for Maximum Flexibility:\nEngineered with Dry-Fit Stretch and Dry-Tech Stretch fabrics, these lowers offer a perfect blend of flexibility, breathability, and durability. The stretchable material moves effortlessly with your body, providing unrestricted motion for running, gym training, yoga, or casual wear \u2014 making them ideal for all-season active lifestyles.", "Comfortable Regular Fit with Adjustable Waistband:\nDesigned for both performance and ease, these lowers feature a flexible elastic waistband with an adjustable drawstring to deliver a secure, customizable fit. The regular fit silhouette offers balanced comfort and support without compromising on style, ensuring you stay comfortable through every activity.", "Durable Polyester Construction for Long-Lasting Wear:\nCrafted from High-quality polyester, these running lowers are built to withstand regular training, running, and outdoor activities. The durable, fade-resistant fabric retains its shape and color, ensuring long-lasting performance, wash after wash.", "Versatile All-Season Activewear Design:\nSuitable for every season, these lowers excel in both warm and cool weather. Their lightweight, quick-drying fabric keeps you cool in the summer while offering a breathable base layer during cooler months \u2014 perfect for running, workouts, casual outings, or lounging in sporty style."],
