    colors: ["Black"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Upgrade your activewear essentials with these high-performance, designed to combine lasting durability, comfort, and versatile style. Made from High-quality, breathable polyester, these joggers feature advanced FLEXVENT, ensuring you stay cool, dry, and flexible through any activity.\nThe regular fit design offers a relaxed yet structured silhouette, while the elastic waistband with adjustable drawstring provides a secure, customized fit. Whether you're at the gym, on a jog, or enjoying a casual day out, these joggers deliver all-season comfort and style.\nBuilt for convenience, they're machine washable and quick-drying, making maintenance effortless while retaining their color, shape, and stretch. From workouts to weekend lounging, these joggers are your go-to for reliable performance and everyday versatility.",
    details: ["High-Quality, Durable Polyester Fabric:\nExpertly crafted with breathable polyester, these joggers provide exceptional durability and long-lasting comfort. The lightweight material promotes airflow, ensuring you stay cool and dry whether you're working out, running, or relaxing on off days.", "Comfortable Regular Fit for Everyday Wear:\nDesigned with a regular fit, these joggers strike the perfect balance between relaxed and structured, offering a comfortable, flattering silhouette that doesn't feel too tight or overly loose \u2014 making them ideal for both active days and casual lounging.", "Elastic Waistband with Adjustable Drawstring:\nEquipped with a flexible elastic waistband and adjustable drawstring, these joggers deliver a secure, personalized fit that stays in place during workouts, jogging, or on-the-go activities, ensuring unrestricted movement and lasting ease.", "Versatile, All-Purpose Activewear Design:\nPerfectly suited for training, jogging, running, gym sessions, or casual outings, these joggers combine modern athletic style with practical functionality, making them an essential addition to your year-round activewear collection.", "Easy-Care, Quick-Drying Fabric:\nDesigned for convenience, these joggers are machine washable and quick-drying. Built with Dry-Fit Stretch, Dry-Tech Stretch they retain their shape, color, and performance through frequent washes, ensuring dependable wear every time."],
