    details: ["FLEXVENT High-Quality Polyester Fabric: Crafted from High Quality polyester these Lower offer unmatched breathability, superior moisture-wicking, and all-day comfort. The microfiber construction ensures anti-static performance and a skin-friendly feel, making them ideal for high-intensity workouts and extended wear.", "Regular Fit for Everyday Comfort: Designed with a balanced regular fit that neither clings too tightly nor hangs loosely, ensuring maximum comfort for every body type. Perfect for daily wear, whether you're heading to the gym, running errands, or just relaxing at home.", "Elastic Waistband with Drawstring Closure: Equipped with a stretchable waistband and internal drawstring, these Lower provide a secure yet adjustable fit. The flexibility makes them ideal for dynamic movements, intense training, or lounging with ease.", "Versatile Design for All-Season Wear: With their clean lines and practical silhouette, these lower pant seamlessly transition from workout sessions to casual outings. Whether you're going for a jog, attending fitness classes, or just stepping out, the design delivers on performance and style.", "Easy Care & Long-Lasting Color Retention: Machine washable and built to withstand frequent washing without losing their shape or color. Quick-drying properties and low-maintenance care make them perfect for everyday, on-the-go lifestyles."],
