    colors: ["Heather"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Upgrade your casualwear essentials with the playR Men's Cotton Heather Club Shorts \u2013 a thoughtfully crafted piece that combines function, form, and freedom. Tailored for men who value comfort as much as clean design, these shorts bring a polished yet relaxed vibe to your wardrobe.\nMade from 100% cotton, the shorts are naturally breathable, super soft to the touch, and highly absorbent \u2014 keeping you cool and dry whether you're on the go or off-duty. The heather finish adds a refined texture, giving it a style edge over basic shorts. Plus, the regular fit and knee-length silhouette make it universally flattering and incredibly wearable.\nThese shorts are built for every season and every reason \u2014 a chill evening at home, a spontaneous weekend getaway, light training sessions, or just a quick coffee run. The elastic waistband with drawstring (if applicable) ensures a personalized fit, while the durable construction means they'll hold up wash after wash.",
    details: ["100% Pure Cotton \u2013 Built for Breathability & Comfort : Made with high-grade, natural cotton, these heather shorts feel soft, lightweight, and breathable against the skin. Perfect for summer, evening wear, and all-day lounging \u2014 they're your go-to for ultimate comfort whether you're training, relaxing, or heading out.", "Knee-Length, Regular Fit \u2013 Designed for Lifestyle Versatility : Features a smart, regular fit with a modern knee-length cut that's not too loose and not too tight \u2014 giving you the ideal balance between mobility and style. Works equally well as gym wear, travel wear, or casual streetwear.", "Stylish Heather Texture \u2013 Sophisticated Yet Relaxed: The heathered fabric finish gives a subtle, upscale vibe, while keeping things effortlessly cool and casual. Combine with polos, tank tops, or oversized tees for an easy, fashion-forward look that transitions from day to night.", "Easy to Maintain \u2013 Machine Wash & Ready to Go : Made for real life. These shorts are machine washable, retain their fit and color even after multiple washes, and are resistant to wear and tear \u2014 so you don't have to worry about high maintenance care.", "Everyday Comfort for Every Occasion :Whether you're relaxing at home, working out, doing errands, or traveling, these shorts deliver all-day comfort. Ideal for summer walks, post-gym downtime, evening hangouts, or even as a stylish sleepwear option."],
