    colors: ["Black"],
    sizes: ["L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Elevate your activewear essentials with the playR Men Adult Training Skin Pant, designed for athletes and fitness enthusiasts who value style, comfort, and durability. Crafted from High Quality polyester Blend, these skin-fit track pants offering breathability, flexibility, and moisture-wicking performance for intense training or daily wear. The regular fit and elastic waistband provide a snug yet relaxed feel, making them suitable for gym workouts, running, sports, or casual outings. With a lightweight, quick-drying fabric that requires minimal maintenance, these training pants are your dependable, all-season go-to for performance and style.",
    details: ["All-Season Comfort: Engineered with Dry-Fit Stretch, and Dry-Tech Stretch, these training skin pants keep you cool in summer and comfortably insulated during cooler months, making them perfect for year-round wear.", "Regular Fit: Designed with a balanced regular fit that offers a sleek, modern look without restricting movement \u2014 ideal for diverse body types and fitness levels, providing both comfort and confidence during any activity.", "Durable Polyester Fabric: Made from high-quality, lightweight polyester Blend, these pants are built to last through intense workouts, running sessions, and casual wear. The fabric resists wrinkles and shrinking while maintaining its shape and feel.", "Multipurpose Versatile Design: Perfectly suited for gym sessions, training, running, sports practice, or casual lounging \u2014 these joggers are an essential wardrobe staple for active men who demand both style and functionality.", "Low-Maintenance Care: With machine-washable, quick-drying properties, these pants require minimal upkeep, retaining their color, flexibility, and performance-ready look even after multiple washes."],
