    colors: ["White"],
    sizes: ["10", "12", "14", "6", "8"],
    description: "The playR Unisex-Kids Cricket Set Junior Regular Fit Polyester Crafted from DRIVENT for All Season is the ideal choice for young cricket enthusiasts. Designed to be worn in any weather, this set is made from high-quality polyester, ensuring comfort and durability. The regular fit provides ample room for movement, allowing kids to play freely and confidently. This cricket set includes a shirt and trousers, both crafted to with stand the rigors of the game while maintaining their shape and Comfort. Suitable for boys and girls, it's perfect for training sessions, matches, and casual play, making it a versatile addition to any junior cricketer's wardrobe.",
    details: ["All-Season Versatility: The playR cricket set is designed for year-round use, making it suitable for all weather conditions. Whether it's a hot summer day or a chilly autumn afternoon, the breathable polyester fabric ensures that young players stay comfortable. The material wicks away sweat, keeping the body dry and cool during intense matches.", "Durable Polyester Fabric: Crafted from high-quality polyester, the playR cricket set is built to last. This durable material is resistant to wear and tear, making it ideal for active kids who play hard. The fabric holds up well against frequent washing, maintaining its shape, color, and integrity over time. Polyester is also lightweight, allowing for easy movement and agility on the field.", "Regular Fit for Comfort: The playR cricket set features a regular fit design that provides a comfortable and relaxed feel. This fit allows for a full range of motion, crucial for executing cricket shots and fielding plays. The shirt and trousers are designed to be neither too tight nor too loose, offering the perfect balance of comfort and functionality. Elasticated waistbands and adjustable features ensure a secure fit without restricting movement.", "Unisex Design for Boys and Girls: With its unisex design, the playR cricket set is suitable for both boys and girls. The versatile design caters to all junior players, making it a great option for mixed-gender teams and training sessions. The stylish and neutral color scheme appeals to kids of all preferences, ensuring everyone feels confident and proud wearing the set.", "Easy Maintenance: The playR cricket set is easy to care for, making it a practical choice for busy parents and active kids. The polyester fabric is machine washable and dries quickly, allowing for hassle-free cleaning and maintenance. The material is also resistant to stains, so minor spills and dirt can be easily washed out."],
