    description: "The playR Adult Unisex Cricket Set is designed for all-season use, ensuring that cricket enthusiasts can enjoy the game year-round. This set includes essential gear made from high-quality polyester, providing durability and comfort. The regular fit ensures a comfortable playing experience for both men and women. Ideal for practice sessions or competitive matches, this cricket set offers everything a player needs to perform at their best, regardless of the weather conditions.",
    details: ["Versatile All-Season Wear: The playR Adult Unisex Cricket Set is designed for year-round performance.Crafted From DRIVENT with high-quality polyester, it offers excellent breathability and moisture-wicking properties, keeping you cool and dry in hot weather while providing warmth during cooler conditions. This versatility ensures that you can focus on your game without being distracted by the elements, making it ideal for both summer and winter cricket seasons.", "Regular Fit for Comfort and Flexibility: Tailored in a regular fit, the cricket set provides ample room for movement without being too loose. This fit ensures that you can execute all your cricketing skills, from batting and bowling to fielding, with ease and comfort. The design accommodates protective gear underneath without feeling bulky, allowing you to maintain agility and responsiveness on the field.", "High-Quality Polyester Fabric: Made from polyester, the playR cricket set combines durability with a lightweight feel. The fabric is resistant to wear and tear, ensuring that the set can withstand the rigors of frequent play. Additionally, polyester's inherent quick-drying properties make it easy to care for, allowing for easy maintenance and long-lasting use, keeping you looking sharp game after game.", "Enhanced Breathability and Moisture Management: The cricket set features moisture-wicking technology that effectively pulls sweat away from the body, promoting quick evaporation. This ensures that you stay dry and comfortable, even during intense matches or practice sessions. Enhanced breathability further contributes to your comfort, preventing overheating and allowing for better focus and performance on the field.", "Unisex Design for Inclusive Fit: The unisex design of the playR cricket set makes it suitable for both men and women. The inclusive design ensures that every player can enjoy the same level of comfort and performance. Available in a range of sizes, the set caters to a wide variety of body types, promoting inclusivity and ensuring that every player can find their perfect fit."],
