    colors: ["Blue"],
    sizes: ["L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "The playR STREET Milan City Series Jacket is built with a 100% polyester shell and 100% polyester lining that feels light, smooth, and easy to wear through long winter days. Its lightweight, comfortable, smooth finish, easy care, wind-resistance, soft interior and versatile, keeping you comfortable during work, travel, and daily movement. it's giving you a relaxed feel even when layered over winter clothes. it reliable in cold or slightly humid weather. Designed for men who prefer a clean streetwear look, this jacket works as a men's winter wear option for office, casual outings, and city travel. It brings the warmth needed for fall-winter without heavy bulk, making it a solid choice for anyone wanting a stylish winter jacket men can use for street style, outdoor plans, and everyday comfort.",
    details: ["\u2714\ufe0f Lightweight Comfort with Soft Interior Feel : Made with a 100% polyester shell and lining, this men's jacket feels light on the body while offering a soft interior touch for daily comfort. It's ideal for long city travel, daily wear, and men's winter wear without making you feel bulky or heavy.", "\u2714\ufe0f Easy-Care, Smooth Finish : The smooth finish polyester fabric gives the jacket a clean, refined look while being easy to care for in daily use. It's built for long-term use. This makes it a low-maintenance jacket for regular office wear, travel, and everyday routines.", "\u2714\ufe0f Stylish & Versatile for Everyday Lifestyle : Designed to match different looks, this modern jacket works well for travel, casual outings, street wear, coffee runs, and daily city life. the playR Milan Warm Jacket adapts effortlessly. Its stylish design and versatile nature make it easy to pair with t-shirts, hoodies, jeans, or sneakers, giving you a balanced and modern everyday outfit.", "\u2714\ufe0f Durable & Wind-Resistant Layer : The strong polyester outer shell offers good durability with basic wind resistance, making it suitable for mild cold, breezy evenings, and urban weather conditions. this men's zip jacket works as a reliable for office use, outdoor plans.", "\u2714\ufe0f Comfortable Fit with All-Day Wearability : The jacket is designed for comfort and flexibility, allowing easy movement while walking, riding, commuting, or travelling. It doesn't feel stiff or tight, making it suitable for long wear hours. The jacket's simple design lets you layer it with different outfits easily."],
