    images: ["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/third.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/fifth.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/2nd_8829a5c3-2b85-411d-804d-63466f0986a5.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/fourth.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/frontimage_jpg.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/1st.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/1st_1.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/2nd.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/4th.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/frontpageimage.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/front_e583f5b6-d118-41d8-b4c4-cc86a3ca3fc4.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/last.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/3rdimage.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/textureshow.oftheimage.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/4thfabricshow.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/mainpageimage.jpg?v=1768547057", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/2NDIMAGE.jpg?v=1768547057"],
    colors: ["Grey"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "XL"],
    description: "The playR STREET Paris City Series Hooded Jacket is designed to give you steady comfort through daily winter routines with ottoman textured fabric. Its shell blends 45% PU and 55% polyester for strength, while the 100% polyester lining stays soft and comfortable for long hours of wear. The jacket keeps you warm without adding weight, making it easy to use for travel, office, or regular city movement. Its hooded streetwear look works well with casual outfits and layered winter clothes. The fabric stays durable, lightweight, skin friendly, and comfortable, supporting smooth motion through fall-winter weather. Whether you need a men's fall winter jacket, a men's travel jacket, or a simple daily wear option, this piece fits naturally into everyday style with reliable warmth and easy comfort.",
    details: ["\u2714\ufe0f Soft & Comfort Features : This jacket is made with ottoman fabric and 45% PU + 55% polyester shell and 100% polyester lining, giving you a durable, soft-lining, warm, lightweight, skin-friendly, and comfort-fit experience\u2014perfect for anyone looking for a reliable men's fall winter jacket for everyday use.", "\u2714\ufe0f Durable & Lightweight for Daily Comfort : This Durable jacket stays strong on the outside and light on the body, giving you smooth, easy comfort whether you're traveling, stepping out in the city, or layering up for winter.", "\u2714\ufe0f Travel-Ready & Easy to Carry : Compact and light enough for backpack or luggage, this jacket is ideal for metro rides, weekend getaways, or city travel without adding bulk or burden. giving you steady insulation during cold days.", "\u2714\ufe0f Stylish & Versatile for Everyday Lifestyle : Designed to match different looks, this modern jacket works well for travel, casual outings, street wear, coffee runs, and daily city life. the playR Milan Warm Jacket adapts effortlessly. Its stylish design and versatile nature make it easy to pair with t-shirts, hoodies, jeans, or sneakers, giving you a balanced and modern everyday outfit.", "\u2714\ufe0f Comfortable Fit with All-Day Wearability : The jacket is designed for comfort and flexibility, allowing easy movement while walking, riding, commuting, or travelling. It doesn't feel stiff or tight, making it suitable for long wear hours. The jacket's simple design lets you layer it with different outfits easily."],
