    colors: ["Navy"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "3XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "playR Men's Solid Dirk Polo T-Shirt is built for movement, made for effortless style, and designed to perform in any setting. Crafted from high-quality, all-season polyester fabric, this polo offers a perfect balance of durability, stretch, and moisture-wicking to keep you feeling fresh and comfortable all day long. The regular fit cut delivers a flattering, athletic  without restricting movement, making it an essential addition to every active wardrobe.\nWhether you're hitting the gym, playing a competitive match, heading out for a casual weekend hang, or simply running daily errands, this versatile t-shirt has you covered. DRIVENT moisture-wicking works to pull sweat away from your skin, keeping you dry, cool, and confident through every activity. The soft, breathable fabric is engineered to resist wrinkles and shrinking, ensuring your tee stays looking sharp, wear after wear.\nDesigned with a classic polo neck and half sleeves, the Dirk Polo T-Shirt transitions effortlessly from training sessions to casual social outings. Its modern, minimalist design makes it suitable for a variety of occasions, from fitness routines and outdoor adventures to relaxed gatherings and daily wear. One tee, many uses \u2014 elevate your everyday style and performance with playR.",
    details: ["Crafted with high-grade polyester, this polo t-shirt is engineered to deliver breathable comfort and maximum flexibility. Its advanced moisture-wicking DRIVENT efficiently pulls sweat away from your skin, keeping you cool and dry during intense summer workouts while offering light insulation for comfort in cooler weather \u2014 making it the perfect all-season choice for training, sports, gym sessions, and casual wear.", "Regular Fit with Polo Neck : Engineered for a relaxed & comfortable this solid polo t-shirt comes with a regular fit cut that suits all body types. The classic polo collar with button placket adds a refined touch, letting you switch seamlessly from workouts to meet-ups without compromising comfort or style.", "Ideal for Multiple Activities : Whether you're at the gym, going for a run, on the court, or simply heading out for the day, this versatile t-shirt performs under pressure. It offers maximum breathability and mobility, making it ideal for football, cricket, badminton, or a casual hangout.", "Low Maintenance, Quick Dry : Say goodbye to ironing and long drying times. This t-shirt is machine washable, wrinkle-resistant, and quick-drying \u2014 perfect for men who are always on the move. It maintains shape and color even after multiple washes, saving you time and effort.", "Clean Solid Design : The minimalist, court-inspired solid color makes it easy to pair with joggers, shorts, or jeans. Whether it's a gym session, travel day, or just lounging, this polo tee offers performance tech wrapped in effortless style. Understated, functional, and fashion-forward."],
