    description: "Introducing the playR Men Solid  Golfer Polo T-shirt, designed for both style and performance. This regular fit, all-season polo is crafted from 100% cotton, ensuring comfort and breathability during your game. The classic polo neck design and solid color make it a versatile addition to any wardrobe, perfect for both on and off the golf course. Whether you're teeing off or enjoying a casual day out, this polo shirt combines functionality with timeless fashion. Upgrade your activewear collection with the playR Men's Adult Golfer Polo T-Shirt\u2014a perfect blend of style, comfort, and functionality for every occasion.",
