    colors: ["White"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "3XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Elevate your everyday style with the playR Men Solid Lifestyle Basico Polo T-shirt. This regular fit polo combines comfort and sophistication, making it a versatile addition to your wardrobe. Crafted from a blend of cotton and polyester, this polo shirt is designed to keep you comfortable and stylish in all seasons. The classic polo neck and solid color ensure a timeless look that pairs effortlessly with jeans, chinos, or shorts. Whether you're heading to a casual outing or a relaxed day at work, the playR Basico Polo T-shirt is your go-to choice for understated elegance and all-day comfort.",
    details: ["Cotton Blend with All-Season Comfort: Crafted using high-quality, absorbent cotton-blend fabric, this polo t-shirt ensures all-day comfort in any season. Whether you're working out in the summer heat or layering up in cooler months, the fabric adapts to your body's needs\u2014keeping you dry, fresh, and active.", "Regular Fit with Athletic Elegance: Designed in a regular fit that flatters a wide range of body types, this half-sleeve polo offers an ideal blend of structured style and relaxed wearability. Its tailored silhouette provides a polished, athletic look\u2014perfect for both performance and casual outings.", "Breathable & Sweat-Release Fabric : With enhanced ventilation and moisture-wicking capabilities, the Basico Polo helps manage sweat efficiently during training or sports. Its breathable weave promotes airflow, preventing overheating and offering superior comfort even during intense physical activity.", "Hypo-Allergenic & Skin-Friendly Material: Ideal for sensitive skin, the t-shirt features hypo-allergenic properties and a smooth texture that reduces irritation and friction. The soft, skin-friendly finish ensures chafe-free movement, making it suitable for prolonged wear during workouts or day-to-day routines.", "Versatile Styling for Active & Everyday Wear: Whether you're heading to the gym, playing outdoor sports, or going for a coffee run, this classic white polo complements every activity. Pair it with joggers, shorts, or jeans\u2014it's a timeless essential that fits into fitness wardrobes and casual collections alike."],
