    description: "Introducing the playR Men's Adult Lifestyle Solid Method Polo T-Shirt, where comfort meets style and innovation. Crafted from high-quality polyester and featuring DRIVENT, this polo is designed for those who demand both performance and fashion in their everyday wear.\nThe regular fit provides a relaxed yet tailored silhouette, perfect for a variety of occasions\u2014from casual outings to intense workouts. Thanks to waterproof and breathable membrane, this polo keeps you dry by effectively repelling moisture from the outside while allowing sweat vapor to escape, ensuring you stay comfortable in all conditions.\nmaking it easy to transition from the gym to social gatherings with effortless style. Easy to care for, this T-shirt is machine washable and quick-drying, maintaining its fresh look wear after wear.\nElevate your wardrobe with the playR Men's Adult Lifestyle Solid Method Polo T-Shirt\u2014your go-to choice for comfort, style, versatility, and cutting-edge weather protection.",
    details: ["DRIVENT Performance: This polo t-shirt is designed to deliver breathable comfort and unrestricted flexibility for any activity. its moisture-wicking fabric keeps you cool and dry during intense summer workouts while offering light insulation for cooler weather. Whether you're training, playing sports, hitting the gym, or enjoying a casual day out, this all-season essential ensures you stay fresh, comfortable, and confidently active year-round.", "Regular Fit with Polo Neck : This solid polo t-shirt comes with a regular fit cut that suits all body types. The classic polo collar with button placket adds a refined touch, letting you switch seamlessly from workouts to meet-ups without compromising comfort or style.", "Ideal for Multiple Activities : Whether you're at the gym, going for a run, on the court, or simply heading out for the day, this versatile t-shirt performs under pressure. It offers maximum breathability and mobility, making it ideal for football, cricket, badminton, or a casual hangout.", "Low Maintenance, Quick Dry : Say goodbye to ironing and long drying times. This t-shirt is machine washable, wrinkle-resistant, and quick-drying \u2014 perfect for men who are always on the move. It maintains shape and color even after multiple washes, saving you time and effort.", "Clean Solid Design : The minimalist, court-inspired solid color makes it easy to pair with joggers, shorts, or jeans. Whether it's a gym session, travel day, or just lounging, this polo tee offers performance tech wrapped in effortless style. Understated, functional, and fashion-forward."],
