    colors: ["Turquoise"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Discover the perfect blend of style, comfort, and advanced performance with the playR Men's Adult Lifestyle Solid Mark Polo T-Shirt. Expertly crafted from high-quality, durable polyester, this polo offers a lightweight, breathable design, making it an ideal choice for any occasion\u2014whether you're hitting the gym, meeting friends, or enjoying a relaxed day at home.\nThe regular fit delivers a relaxed yet tailored silhouette, ensuring freedom of movement and a flattering look for every body type. Designed with  DRIVENT, this polo goes beyond ordinary activewear by providing superior moisture protection. Innovative fabric repels external moisture while allowing sweat vapor to escape, keeping you dry, fresh, and comfortable, even during high-intensity activities or warm weather.",
    details: ["Made from high-quality, durable polyester with DRIVENT for superior comfort, breathability, and moisture protection. Perfect for workouts, casual outings, and all-day wear.", "Regular Fit with Polo Neck : Engineered for a relaxed yet sharp silhouette, this solid polo t-shirt comes with a regular fit cut that suits all body types. The classic polo collar with button placket adds a refined touch, letting you switch seamlessly from workouts to meet-ups without compromising comfort or style.", "Ideal for Multiple Activities : Whether you're at the gym, going for a run, on the court, or simply heading out for the day, this versatile t-shirt performs under pressure. It offers maximum breathability and mobility, making it ideal for football, cricket, badminton, or a casual hangout.", "Low Maintenance, Quick Dry : Say goodbye to ironing and long drying times. This t-shirt is machine washable, wrinkle-resistant, and quick-drying \u2014 perfect for men who are always on the move. It maintains shape and color even after multiple washes, saving you time and effort.", "Clean Solid Design : The minimalist, court-inspired solid color makes it easy to pair with joggers, shorts, or jeans. Whether it's a gym session, travel day, or just lounging, this polo tee offers performance tech wrapped in effortless style. Understated, functional, and fashion-forward."],
