    details: ["COMFORTABLE REGULAR FIT FOR DAILY USE: Crafted with FLEXVENT, this Star Polo T-Shirt offers unrestricted movement and all-day comfort\u2014perfect for men who want style without compromising on ease. Whether you're at the office or out on a weekend, it fits right in.", "POLYESTER-SPANDEX FABRIC: With a high-performance blend of polyester and spandex, this polo tee is soft, breathable, and stretchable\u2014giving you flexibility for all types of lifestyle moments, from relaxing at home to running errands or hitting the gym.", "MOISTURE-WICKING & WRINKLE-RESISTANT: Stay fresh and dry! This polo shirt wicks sweat away from the body and resists wrinkles, making it a go-to option for travel, hot climates, or long workdays. No ironing hassle, no sticky discomfort.", "STYLISH SOLID DESIGN WITH STAR DETAIL: Stand out with understated charm\u2014featuring a clean solid base and subtle star-inspired style. A versatile tee that works for brunches, coffee runs, light workouts, or dinner with friends.", "EASY CARE & ALL-SEASON WEAR: Designed for year-round versatility. Wear it in summer with shorts or layer it under a jacket during winters. Machine-washable, quick-drying, and fade-resistant\u2014effortless to care for, every single time."],
