    details: ["Designed for Versatile All-Day Performance: The playR Core Polo T-Shirt is your reliable go-to for everything from intense workouts to laid-back weekends. With a perfect balance of comfort and performance, it seamlessly transitions between the gym, office, or casual meetups\u2014offering functionality and polished style in one.", "Breathable & Sweat-Wicking for Active Use: Built using lightweight, breathable fabric that efficiently releases heat and moisture, this polo keeps you cool and dry throughout the day. Whether you're in a training session or walking outdoors, the quick-dry technology works hard to maintain comfort and freshness.", "Hypo-Allergenic Comfort with Skin-Safe Fabric: Specially engineered with hypo-allergenic material, this tee is ideal for sensitive skin. It reduces irritation and prevents chafing, making it suitable for long-duration wear in any weather\u2014ensuring smooth comfort and breathability all year round.", "Regular Fit : The structured polo collar, functional design, and clean seams offer a sharp look without restricting movement. Whether worn tucked or untucked, this activewear polo offers a flattering regular fit that suits all body types and settings.", "All-Season Wearability Meets Classic Design: With its timeless cut and subtle branding, the playR Core Polo effortlessly adapts to any season or scenario. It's lightweight for summer, layered easily for winter, and remains a dependable wardrobe essential no matter the occasion."],
