    colors: ["DrewBerry"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "The playR Base Polo is where everyday comfort meets timeless style. Crafted High quality polyester with DRIVENT. this solid polo t-shirt is soft, breathable, and designed for all-season wear. With a regular fit and classic polo neck, it's versatile enough to take you from a meeting room to a coffee shop or an evening walk. Whether you're dressing it up with chinos or keeping it cool with joggers, the Base Polo fits effortlessly into your lifestyle. It's easy to wash, quick-drying, and made to move with you\u2014making it a must-have in every man's wardrobe.",
    details: ["Stylish All-Purpose Polo T-Shirt for Men : The playR Base Polo is a go-to staple for every man. Designed with a smart polo neckline and solid color finish, it blends effortlessly into casual, office, or activewear wardrobes. Whether you're heading to work, running errands, or traveling, this t-shirt keeps you looking sharp.", "High Quality Polyester Fabric for Breathability & Durability : Made with high-quality polyester, this men's t-shirt ensures excellent airflow, moisture-wicking properties, and all-day comfort. It's lightweight, smooth on skin, and resists wrinkles\u2014ideal for your busy lifestyle.", "Regular Fit Designed for Everyday Comfort : The t-shirt features a relaxed regular fit that flatters all body types. It provides ease of movement without clinging to the body, making it perfect for both laid-back weekends and long workdays.", "Easy Maintenance \u2013 Quick-Dry & Machine Washable : Say goodbye to high-maintenance clothing. The Base Polo is machine washable, quick drying, and retains its shape and color after every wash. Built for men who value style without the fuss.", "Year-Round Wear \u2013 Versatile for All Seasons & Occasions : From summer to winter, this polo tee adapts to the season. Layer it under jackets or wear it as-is during warm days. It's a multi-occasion piece\u2014great for sports, casual meetups, office settings, or travel."],
