    colors: ["White"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL", "XS"],
    description: "The playR Unisex Adult Cricket Regular Fit Polo Neck T-Shirt is a versatile and essential piece of apparel for cricket enthusiasts, Crafted from DRIVENT High-quality polyester, regular fit design of the playR T-shirt strikes a perfect balance between comfort and mobility. It is tailored to provide a relaxed yet snug fit that does not constrict movement, allowing players to perform at their best. Whether batting, bowling, or fielding, the T-shirt offers the freedom of movement necessary for executing cricket techniques effectively. This regular fit is complemented by the stylish polo neck. Its blend of durability, comfort, and functionality makes it an indispensable part of any cricket player's gear. Whether you are a seasoned professional or an enthusiastic amateur, Its all-season adaptability, combined with the regular fit and moisture-wicking properties, ensures that you are always prepared for the challenges of the game, no matter the weather conditions.",
    details: ["All-Season Comfort: Crafted from high-quality polyester, the playR Unisex Adult Cricket Polo Neck T-Shirt ensures maximum comfort in all weather conditions, keeping you cool in the summer and warm during cooler seasons, making it ideal for year-round use.", "Durable & Long-Lasting: This T-shirt is designed to withstand the rigors of cricket practice and matches. The polyester fabric is both strong and resilient, ensuring that it maintains its shape, color, and integrity even after multiple washes.", "Regular Fit for Mobility: The regular fit design offers a perfect balance between comfort and mobility, allowing for a full range of motion during intense cricket activities. Whether batting, bowling, or fielding, you'll have the freedom to perform at your best.", "Polo Neck Style: The stylish polo neck not only adds a touch of classic elegance but also provides additional coverage and comfort. It's perfect for both on-field performance and off-field casual wear, making it a versatile addition to any cricket enthusiast's wardrobe.", "Moisture-Wicking Technology: Engineered with advanced moisture-wicking properties, this T-shirt effectively manages sweat, keeping you dry and comfortable throughout the game. It helps to regulate body temperature, ensuring you stay focused and cool under pressure."],
