    colors: ["Black"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "3XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL", "XS"],
    description: "The playR Men's Adult Lifestyle Doodle Tee is a versatile and stylish addition to any wardrobe, perfect for all seasons. Crafted from High quality cotton, this T-shirt offers exceptional comfort and breathability, making it ideal for daily wear. The round neck design, combined with half sleeves, provides a classic yet contemporary look that suits a variety of occasions, whether you're heading out for a casual day with friends or lounging at home. What sets this tee apart is its unique doodle design, which adds a playful and creative touch to your outfit, making it an eye-catching piece that stands out in any setting. Whether paired with jeans, shorts, or layered under a jacket, this T-shirt is a must-have for those who appreciate a blend of comfort, style, and individuality. Embrace your personal style with the playR Men's Adult Lifestyle Doodle Tee, a perfect choice for anyone looking to make a statement effortlessly.",
    details: ["Stay Comfortable All Day \u2013 Lightweight & Breathable Fabric:\nThe playR Doodle Tee is crafted using ultra-lightweight fabric that promotes superior air circulation, keeping your body cool and sweat-free during intense workouts, morning jogs, or just a laid-back day out.", "Gentle on Skin \u2013 Hypo-Allergenic & Skin Friendly for Everyday Wear:\nThis activewear tee features a Hypo-allergenic, soft-touch finish that prevents skin irritation Whether you're training at the gym or just lounging casually, the skin-friendly texture ensures itch-free comfort, making it ideal for sensitive skin types. It's built for movement, made for comfort, and perfect for daily routines.", "Versatile for Every Day\u2013 Gym, Running, Casual, or Travel:\nFrom high-intensity fitness routines, yoga sessions, and running sprints to casual strolls, weekend outings, or airport looks \u2013 this half-sleeve Doodle T-shirt blends performance and fashion. Pair it with joggers, denims, or shorts to create versatile looks without compromising function.", "Unique Lifestyle :\nyour outfit a creative, youthful twist. This tee isn't just a piece of apparel \u2013 it's wearable art. It reflects personality, freedom, and fun while still offering the high-performance benefits of activewear like quick-drying, sweat absorption, and stretch comfort.", "All-Season, Durable Performance \u2013 Built to Last Wash After Wash:\nWhether you're braving the summer sun or layering up during winter, the all-season fabric adapts to your body's needs. The durable stitching, fade-resistant, and strong color retention allow this tee to look fresh and last long."],
