    images: ["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/1_1ed95601-2c6b-487e-ba9d-b5ef486c6d11.jpg?v=1756796498", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/2_080abbef-fea0-46e1-a82b-7f82b81d6137.jpg?v=1756796498", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/3_3cb23b10-cd77-4017-ab00-c35901ee592f.jpg?v=1756796498", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/4_aed99661-7543-4efa-be1d-086cc4986f5d.jpg?v=1756796498", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/5_24a2f36b-218a-44af-beec-37a89ab3b880.jpg?v=1756796498"],
    colors: ["Black"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "3XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL", "XS"],
    description: "Step into active comfort with the playR Men Let's Play Tee \u2013 a breathable, lightweight, and performance-driven half sleeve t-shirt built for today's active man. Whether you're hitting the gym, running your daily miles, or enjoying a casual day out, this tee delivers unmatched softness and moisture control with every wear. Designed with absorbent, sweat-release fabric and skin-friendly properties, it ensures irritation-free performance even during intense sessions. With hypo-allergenic fabric and a regular fit that flatters all body types, it adapts to your movement across all seasons. Make every moment active \u2013 with the confidence, comfort, and functionality of the Let's Play Tee.",
    details: ["Engineered for All-Day Breathability & Comfort:\nThe playR Let's Play Tee is designed using lightweight and highly breathable fabric that ensures maximum airflow, keeping you dry and cool throughout your gym session, run, or daily wear. The sweat release and absorbent helps wick away moisture quickly.", "Skin-Friendly & Hypo-Allergenic for Sensitive Skin:\nTailored with soft-touch 100% Cotton fabric that's skin friendly and hypo-allergenic, this tee ensures zero irritation, even after long hours of wear. It's ideal for men with sensitive skin who prioritize comfort, especially during intense workouts or high-humidity conditions.", "Multi-Purpose Wear for Fitness, Gym, and Everyday Style:\nWhether you're lifting at the gym, sprinting on the track, or simply running errands, this half sleeve activewear t-shirt blends function with fashion.", "All-Season Performance Tee That Moves with You:\nBuilt for flexibility and movement, this regular fit performance t-shirt adapts to your activity level \u2013 from hot summers to breezy winters. Its all-season adaptability makes it a year-round go-to for men who seek comfort and style without compromise.", "Durable & Easy to Maintain \u2013 Built to Last:\nCrafted with stitching and durable cotton material, this tee retains its shape, color, and softness even after repeated washes. It's not just a workout tee \u2013 it's a long-lasting wardrobe essential that performs as hard as you do."],
