    colors: ["Red"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL", "XS"],
    description: "Elevate your activewear with the playR TERRAIN TEE, expertly designed for men who demand comfort and performance. Crafted from High polyester, this lightweight T-shirt offers exceptional durability, making it perfect for all your outdoor adventures and gym sessions. The TERRAIN TEE features advanced moisture-wicking that efficiently pulls sweat away from your skin, ensuring you stay dry and comfortable, keeping you cool during warm weather or vigorous activities. With a modern fit. The stylish design allows you to transition effortlessly from the gym to everyday wear. it's machine washable and quick-drying, ensuring you can keep it looking fresh and vibrant after every wash. Experience the perfect blend of style, comfort, and functionality with the playR TERRAIN TEE\u2014your new go-to for any active lifestyle.",
    details: ["Designed for Training & Recovery \u2013 Lightweight Performance Tee: This tee is built to handle it all \u2014 from high-intensity training sessions to post-workout recovery. The lightweight polyester fabric wicks away sweat and keeps you feeling cool, dry, and comfortable no matter how hard you push.", "DRIVENT - Polyester \u2013 Breathable & All-Season Wear: Crafted with high-performance polyester, this tee is made to be worn year-round. It's quick-drying, breathable, and ultra-soft, making it perfect for gym workouts, runs, or even daily casual wear.", "Regular Fit & Round Neck \u2013 Moves With You: Designed with a relaxed regular fit and classic crew neck, this t-shirt offers full freedom of movement while giving a neat silhouette that suits all body types \u2014 no cling, no stiffness.", "Stylish Vibrant Color Collection \u2013 Bold Yet Understated: The Vibrant color collection gives the tee a clean, powerful look that works well in both sporty and casual settings. Pair it with joggers, track pants, or shorts for a versatile, on-trend fit.", "Easy Care & Long-Lasting Fabric: No fuss, no drama. This tee is machine washable, wrinkle-resistant, and color-stable \u2014 built to last through daily wear and regular washing without losing shape or softness."],
