    colors: ["White"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL", "XS"],
    description: "Elevate your workout wardrobe with the playR Men's Adult Training Tee. DRIVENT- polyester fabric that ensures durability and breathability. Whether you're hitting the gym, going for a run, or simply enjoying an active day out, this tee provides the perfect balance of style and functionality. The moisture-wicking effectively draws sweat away from your skin, keeping you dry and comfortable during even the most intense workouts. Ideal for all seasons, this versatile tee can be easily layered or worn on its own, making it a staple for any fitness enthusiast. Plus Upgrade your training gear with the playR Men's Training Tee and experience the perfect blend of style, comfort, and performance.",
    details: ["All-Season Training T-Shirt for Men \u2013 The playR Men's Training Tee is crafted for year-round performance, ideal for gym workouts, running, yoga, sports, and daily wear. Its breathable build makes it perfect for both indoor and outdoor activities.", "Moisture-Wicking Quick Dry Fabric \u2013 Made with High Quality polyester dry-fit material, this sports t-shirt for men absorbs sweat quickly and promotes airflow, keeping you dry, fresh, and comfortable during intense workouts or long hours of wear.", "Regular Fit with Round Neck and Half Sleeves \u2013 Designed for a comfortable athletic fit, the t-shirt features a classic crew neck and short sleeves, offering maximum freedom of movement and a sporty, casual look that works with any bottom wear.", "Ideal for Gym, Running, Yoga, and Sports \u2013 Whether you're training hard at the gym, jogging outdoors, doing CrossFit, or just relaxing, this versatile activewear t-shirt delivers both performance and casual comfort in every setting.", "Durable, Lightweight & Easy to Maintain \u2013 This training t-shirt for men is machine washable, fade-resistant, and retains its shape after repeated use. Its lightweight polyester construction makes it perfect for travel, commute, or daily use without hassle."],
