    colors: ["Red"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "3XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Take your performance and comfort to new heights with the playR Aspher Run Tee \u2014 the ultimate activewear essential for men who demand style, functionality, and durability. Engineered from lightweight, breathable polyester, this  running and training T-shirt is enhanced with DRIVENT that actively repels external moisture while wicking away sweat to keep you cool and dry.\n\nThe innovative Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech systems ensure fast moisture evaporation, making this tee your perfect partner for everything from intense workouts and long-distance runs to casual, everyday wear. With its regular fit and breathable construction, the Aspher Run Tee allows unrestricted movement and all-day comfort.",
    details: ["DRIVENT Enhanced Performance Fabric:\nStay dry, comfortable, and confident with the playR Aspher Run Tee, meticulously crafted from high-quality polyester. ensuring you stay cool and dry during long runs, gym workouts, or casual outdoor adventures in any season.", "Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit & Dry-Tech Sweat-Wicking Power:\nBuilt for serious runners and training enthusiasts, this tee combines Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech systems that work together to absorb sweat instantly and promote rapid evaporation. this T-shirt keeps you light, dry, and fresh through intense cardio sessions, strength training, or everyday wear.", "Regular Fit with Lightweight, Breathable Comfort:\nDesigned with a regular athletic fit, lightweight, breathable fabric maximizes airflow, preventing overheating during workouts and making it an ideal choice for long-distance runs, gym training, or all-day casual wear.", "Stylish, Versatile Design for All-Season Activewear:\nWith its clean, minimalist design and classic crew neck, the Aspher Run Tee seamlessly transitions from fitness sessions to casual hangouts. Pair it with running shorts, joggers, or jeans for a sporty, effortless look that works year-round, whether you're out for a morning jog or meeting friends after your workout.", "Durable, Easy-Care :\nDurable polyester T-shirt retains its shape, color, and performance even after multiple washes. It's machine washable, quick-drying, and built to last, making it a reliable essential for your activewear wardrobe."],
