    colors: ["Red"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Push your training sessions further with the playR Rector Tee \u2014 a performance-driven essential designed for men who demand durability, comfort, and style in their activewear. Made from lightweight, breathable polyester and enhanced with DRIVENT, this tee ensures superior moisture protection and sweat-wicking capabilities.\nThanks to the integration of Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech performance systems, the Rector Tee actively absorbs moisture and accelerates evaporation to keep you cool and dry, whether you're working out in the gym, running outdoors, or simply on the move. Its regular fit and breathable construction allow unrestricted movement and all-day comfort.",
    details: ["DRIVENT Fabric for Moisture Protection:\nThe playR Rector Tee is engineered with cutting-edge, designed to repel external moisture while pulling sweat away from your skin. Whether you're running under the sun or hitting the gym, this advanced moisture management keeps you comfortably dry, fresh, and focused on your activity, no matter the intensity or season.", "Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech Triple Action Performance:\nSay goodbye to sticky, uncomfortable workout shirts. The playR Rector Tee combines Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech features for superior moisture-wicking and rapid drying. This technology works to instantly absorb sweat and facilitate quick evaporation, making it ideal for high-performance training sessions, cardio, and outdoor adventures.", "Lightweight, Breathable Comfort with Regular Fit:\nDesigned for versatility and performance, this tee features a lightweight, breathable polyester fabric that allows air to circulate freely, preventing overheating during intense workouts. The regular fit ensures a comfortable, natural range of motion while providing a clean, athletic silhouette suitable for both active and casual settings.", "Year-Round Activewear with All-Season Adaptability:\nNo need to swap shirts between seasons. The playR Rector Tee is built for all-season performance, offering a cooling effect during hot days and light, breathable insulation when temperatures drop. Its versatile design makes it perfect for running, gym workouts, casual wear, or layering under jackets in cooler weather.", "Durable, Fade-Resistant, and Easy-Care Construction:\nCrafted with high-quality, fade-resistant polyester, this T-shirt is built to endure frequent use and multiple washes without losing its shape, color, or performance properties. Machine washable and quick-drying, it's a dependable, low-maintenance essential for athletes and fitness enthusiasts alike."],
