    colors: ["Teal"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "The playR Core Run T Shirt for Men is designed to support your active lifestyle\u2014whether you're hitting the gym, going for a run, or stepping out for casual wear. Crafted By DRIVENT Made with quick dry fit polyester fabric, this t-shirt ensures a smooth, irritation-free experience through intense workouts or daily routines. Engineered for style and performance, it offers the right balance of flexibility and durability. From gym sessions to casual outings, this t-shirt is your go-to for all-day comfort and movement.",
    details: ["DRYvent Moisture-Repellent for Superior Dryness:\nStay dry and focused through your most intense runs, gym workouts, or outdoor training with the playR Core Run Tee, powered byDRIVENT. This high-performance fabric is engineered to repel external moisture and efficiently wick sweat away from your skin, ensuring a dry, cool, and comfortable experience, even in humid or high-pressure conditions.", "Triple Performance System: Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit & Dry-Tech:\nThe Core Run Tee is designed with a trio of sweat management innovations \u2014 Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech \u2014 for unrivaled moisture-wicking performance. It rapidly absorbs perspiration and promotes fast evaporation, keeping you cool and light throughout long-distance runs, high-impact training, or active daily wear.", "Lightweight, Breathable, and Regular Fit Comfort:\nConstructed from lightweight, breathable polyester fabric, this T-shirt ensures constant airflow, preventing overheating during intense physical activities. The regular fit design offers a relaxed, athletic silhouette that allows unrestricted movement, making it perfect for sports, gym sessions, or casual wear on any day.", "Versatile All-Season Activewear for Every Activity:\nDesigned to adapt to every season, the playR Core Run Tee is an essential for year-round training. It keeps you cool and sweat-free during hot summer workouts, while providing a breathable base layer for cooler days. Whether you're running, training, playing sports, or relaxing casually, this tee delivers consistent performance and comfort.", "Durable, Fade-Resistant, and Low-Maintenance Fabric:\nBuilt for daily wear and frequent washing, this high-quality, fade-resistant T-shirt maintains its vibrant color, fit, and performance wash after wash. It's machine washable, quick-drying, and easy to care for, making it a reliable go-to in your activewear wardrobe."],
