    colors: ["White"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Step into all-day comfort and effortless style with the playR Men Merc Vip Tee \u2013 the ultimate fusion of lifestyle and activewear. This half sleeve tee delivers a breathable, absorbent, and sweat-release performance, perfect for both workouts and laid-back days. Whether you're at the gym, on a run, or just heading out casually, the hypo-allergenic, skin-friendly fabric offers itch-free, cool comfort in any season. Its lightweight feel and durable design make it a reliable choice for men who demand more from their basics \u2013 more comfort, more performance, and more versatility.",
    details: ["Mercerised Finish for Comfort & Style:\nThe playR Merc Vip Tee is designed with a mercersied cotton finish, offering a stylish look and feel that elevates your activewear game. Smooth and incredibly soft on skin\u2014ideal for gym, work-from-home days, or even casual outings.", "All-Season Lightweight Performance \u2013 Breathable & Sweat-Release:\nMade from lightweight, breathable fabric, this tee ensures optimal airflow and quick moisture management. Its sweat-release and absorbent keeps you dry and fresh even during high-intensity workouts or long summer days.", "Skin-Friendly & Hypo-Allergenic for Sensitive Skin:\nDesigned for daily comfort, the fabric is hypo-allergenic and skin friendly, offering irritation-free wear even during extended use. Whether you're running, training, or relaxing, the soft, non-abrasive material ensures all-day comfort without itchiness or redness.", "Versatile Lifestyle-Activewear Crossover for Every Occasion:\nThe Merc Vip Tee blends performance and street-ready style, making it suitable for multiple settings. From the gym to casual weekends, or from running errands to evening meetups, this half sleeve tee adapts to your pace and your day effortlessly.", "Durable Quality That Lasts \u2013 Easy Care and Fade-Resistant:\nCrafted with strong stitching and high-quality fabric, this tee is built to handle daily wear and frequent washes. It maintains its shape, color, and soft texture over time, ensuring long-term use without compromising comfort or performance."],
