    details: ["Dry Fit Polyester Performance: Crafted from 100% polyester with DRIVENT for fast sweat evaporation and enhanced breathability.Ensuring that you keep cool and Comfortable.", "Perfect for Running, Gym & Sports: Ideal for jogging, gym workouts, sports training, and everyday fitness routines.", "Lightweight & Sweatproof Comfort: This t-shirt is Ultra-light feel that keeps you sweat-free, cool, and odorless during all Weather workouts.", "Skin-Friendly & Hypoallergenic: Gentle on skin with no itching or irritation\u2014suitable for long hours of wear.You can enjoy any outdoor vacation with this tee.", "All-Season Men's Activewear: Wear it solo in summer or layer it under jackets in winter\u2014made for year-round performance."],
