    colors: ["White"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Stay active, comfortable, and confidently styled all day with the playR Men's Solid Terro Tee \u2014 a next-generation high-performance t-shirt designed for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and men on the move. Built for action and crafted with precision, this tee features ultra-lightweight, breathable polyester fabric that works in harmony with your body. Enhanced with DRIVENT moisture-wicking, it actively draws sweat away from your skin and disperses it across the surface for quick evaporation \u2014 keeping you cool, dry, and focused no matter the challenge.\nEquipped with a powerful trio of Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech performance systems, the Terro Tee ensures fast moisture absorption and rapid sweat release, allowing you to train harder, run longer, and recover in comfort. Whether you're powering through intense gym sessions, going for a morning run, or just enjoying a casual day out, this all-season tee keeps up with your pace.",
    details: ["DRIVENT Moisture-Wicking Fabric for Maximum Comfort:\nStay dry, fresh, and focused through every workout with the playR Men's Solid Terro Tee, designed with advanced DRYvent technology. This high-performance fabric pulls sweat away from your skin and dries rapidly, ensuring long-lasting comfort whether you're training at the gym, out on a run, or enjoying a casual day out.", "Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit & Dry-Tech Sweat Management System:\nExperience peak performance with the tee's Quick-Dry, Dry-Fit, and Dry-Tech features \u2014 engineered to absorb moisture fast and accelerate evaporation. The innovative sweat management system keeps you light, cool, and dry during high-intensity workouts or extended hours of casual wear in any season.", "Lightweight, Breathable, and Regular Fit Comfort:\nConstructed from lightweight, High-quality polyester, this T-shirt promotes excellent airflow and temperature control. Its regular fit silhouette provides a comfortable, relaxed athletic shape, allowing unrestricted movement for running, weight training, or active everyday wear.", "Versatile All-Season Activewear for Training & Casual Style:\nPerfect for both performance and leisure, the playR Terro Tee is an all-season essential. It keeps you cool in the summer and serves as a lightweight, moisture-wicking base layer in colder weather. Ideal for running, training, gym sessions, sports, or casual daily use.", "Durable, Fade-Resistant & Easy-Care Fabric:\nBuilt to last through frequent workouts and regular washing, this T-shirt's durable, fade-resistant fabric retains its shape, color, and performance properties over time. Machine washable and quick-drying, it's a dependable, low-maintenance staple for your activewear collection."],
