    soldOut: true,
    description: "Stay warm, focused, and effortlessly sharp with the playR Men's Solid Training Long Sleeve T-Shirt \u2014 your ideal companion for workouts during cooler months. Tailored for high-performance comfort, this regular fit, full-sleeve activewear tee is crafted from DRIVENT - High Quality moisture-wicking polyester that keeps sweat at bay while retaining warmth. Whether you're lifting weights at the gym, hitting the track on a crisp morning, or training outdoors in winter, its lightweight yet insulating design delivers breathable protection without bulk. The round neck silhouette and solid-color aesthetic offer a clean, athletic look that transitions smoothly from training sessions to casual wear. With flexible stretch and skin-friendly fabric, the Solid Training Tee provides enhanced mobility and lasting comfort \u2014 making it an essential layer in your activewear lineup for fall, winter, and beyond.",
    details: ["Material: High Quality Polyester for Lasting Comfort & Durability\nCrafted with DRIVENT-high-grade polyester, this long sleeve training T-shirt offers exceptional durability while ensuring a soft and smooth texture against the skin. making it an ideal choice for athletes and active individuals seeking long-lasting performance wear.", "Fit: Regular Fit for a Comfortable, Flattering, and Non-Restrictive\nDesigned with a regular fit cut, this T-shirt delivers a comfortable, easygoing fit that suits a range of body types. It provides ample room for movement without feeling baggy or overly tight, ensuring both style and ease of motion whether you're stretching, lifting, running, or simply relaxing after a workout.", "Neckline: Classic Round Neck Design for Timeless Versatility\nFeaturing a neatly finished round neck design, this training tee maintains a classic, universally flattering look that works well for both active and casual settings. The round neckline complements the clean, minimal style of the shirt while providing a comfortable, irritation-free fit around the collarbone area.", "Performance : Moisture-Wicking Fabric Keeps You Dry and Fresh\nStay cool, dry, and focused even during high-intensity training sessions thanks to the moisture-wicking capabilities of this T-shirt's polyester fabric. It efficiently draws sweat away from the skin to the outer surface, where it can evaporate quickly, helping regulate body temperature and preventing discomfort from damp, clingy clothing.", "Breathability: Lightweight, Airflow-Enhancing Fabric for Superior Ventilation\nEngineered with a lightweight and breathable polyester material, this T-shirt promotes excellent airflow and helps minimize overheating during workouts. The breathable construction ensures consistent ventilation, making it a dependable choice for fitness routines, outdoor activities, or layering in transitional weather"],
