    details: ["Heavy-Duty Construction: Built with high-grade, this cricket kit bag ensures exceptional durability, tear resistance, and weather protection. Designed to endure the demands of frequent travel, training sessions, and tough match days.", "Spacious Multi-Compartment Storage: Thoughtfully designed with a large main compartment, multiple side pockets, and a separate bat holder, it offers ample space for carrying all your cricket gear \u2014 including pads, gloves, helmets, shoes, bottles, and personal essentials \u2014 keeping everything organized and easily accessible.", "Comfortable & Ergonomic Carry Design: Featuring padded, adjustable shoulder straps and a cushioned grab handle, this kit bag provides multiple convenient carrying options for players on the move. The ergonomic design reduces strain and ensures easy transport, even when fully loaded.", "Quick-Dry & Moisture-Resistant Fabric: The fabric helps repel sweat and dampness while promoting airflow, keeping your cricket gear dry and fresh during intense sessions and unpredictable weather.", "Ideal for Training, Matches & Travel: Whether you're heading to local practice, competitive tournaments, or traveling with your squad, the playR Cricket Kit Bag - KBT-1001 delivers reliable, all-season performance and modern athletic styling for serious cricketers."],
