    colors: ["Grey"],
    sizes: ["One Size"],
    description: "The playR Professional Pickleball Carry Bag is designed for players who want organized, safe, and stylish storage for their pickleball gear. Made from durable polyester, this lightweight bag can comfortably hold up to 2 paddles and 4 balls or more, making it perfect for training sessions, practice drills, competitive matches, or casual outdoor and indoor games. Measuring 42 \u00d7 24 \u00d7 7cm, it provides ample space while remaining easy to carry, travel-friendly, and compact enough for sports events or fitness sessions.\n\nThe dual-compartment design includes padded sections that protect paddles from scratches and impact, while securely holding balls and small accessories. A smooth zip closure ensures your equipment stays safe during transport. The ergonomic top handle allows effortless carrying, while the sleek grey finish with a printed logo gives the bag a professional, modern look.\n\nIdeal for kids and adults, this carry bag combines durability, functionality, and style. It is easy to clean, versatile for various settings, and a reliable choice for anyone looking to keep their pickleball equipment organized, protected, and ready for action, whether for practice, training, or competitive match play.",
    details: ["\u2714\ufe0f Spacious Paddle & Ball Storage \u2013 Designed to comfortably hold up to 2 pickleball paddles and 4 balls, this pickleball carry bag keeps all your gear neatly organized and accessible. Perfect for training sessions, practice drills, competitive matches, and casual outdoor or indoor games, ensuring everything you need is in one place.", "\u2714\ufe0f Durable & Lightweight Construction \u2013 Crafted from high-quality Fabric, the bag offers long-lasting strength while remaining lightweight for easy transport. Its robust material with tands daily use, outdoor exposure, and repeated handling, making it reliable for kids and adults alike.", "\u2714\ufe0f Easy-Carry Design with Secure Zip Closure \u2013 Featuring a convenient top handle and a smooth zip closure, the Pickle Ball bag ensures effortless carrying and safe storage of paddles, balls, and small accessories during travel, sports events, or outdoor games.", "\u2714\ufe0f Padded Protection for Gear \u2013 Thoughtfully designed padded compartments safeguard paddles from scratches, bumps, and impact damage, while also keeping balls and other accessories neatly arranged. This ensures your equipment stays in excellent condition, even during frequent transport.", "\u2714\ufe0f Stylish, Travel-Friendly & Versatile \u2013 Finished in sleek grey with a white printed logo, this pickleball game bag combines professional style with functionality. Easy to clean and versatile, it's ideal for indoor and outdoor games, training sessions, fitness routines, and competitive play for both kids and adults."],
