    colors: ["Blue/Gold"],
    sizes: ["5", "6", "FULL"],
    description: "Unleash your potential on the cricket field with the playR OGR English Willow Cricket Bat, designed for players who demand quality, performance, and durability in every season. Crafted from premium, hand-selected English willow, this bat delivers exceptional performance whether you're facing spin, seam, or pace attacks. Its lightweight design ensures effortless bat speed, while the superior balance and expertly distributed weight give you absolute control over your strokes \u2014 be it a powerful cover drive, a delicate flick, or a precise defensive shot.\n\nThe ergonomic, durable handle provides a firm, comfortable grip and excellent shock absorption, reducing hand fatigue and improving playability during long innings. Designed for versatility, the playR OGR is perfectly suited for use on various pitch types \u2014 from turf wickets to matting \u2014 and stands up to the demands of year-round cricket action. Whether you're in training nets or a competitive match, this bat delivers reliable, consistent performance for players aiming to sharpen their skills and dominate the game.",
    details: ["English Willow Construction: Crafted from carefully selected, high-grade English willow, the playR OGR bat delivers excellent durability, reliable performance, and a natural, classic feel that cricket enthusiasts appreciate. Ideal for both practice sessions and competitive matches.", "Lightweight Design for Effortless Stroke Play: Engineered with a lightweight profile, this bat offers young and developing players superb control and ease of handling. Its reduced weight ensures quicker bat speed, making it easier to play precision shots and react to fast deliveries.", "Superior Balance and Pick-Up: The playR OGR bat features exceptional balance with a perfectly distributed weight profile, ensuring comfortable pick-up and control. Whether playing defensive strokes or powerful drives, this bat offers smooth handling for improved shot consistency.", "Durable, Ergonomic Handle: Designed with a strong, shock-absorbing handle, this cricket bat provides enhanced grip and excellent impact absorption, reducing strain on the hands and arms while ensuring superior performance and control during extended play sessions.", "Versatile, All-Season Performance: Built to perform in varying pitch and weather conditions, the playR OGR English Willow Cricket Bat is a dependable choice for cricketers throughout the year. Its robust construction ensures consistent performance, whether on turf, matting, or practice nets."],
