    details: ["PREMIUM KASHMIR WILLOW CONSTRUCTION: Crafted from high-quality Kashmir Willow, the playR Fluid Cricket Bat offers excellent durability, balance, and strength \u2014 making it ideal for casual tennis ball matches, street cricket, and practice sessions.", "LIGHTWEIGHT & EASY SWING DESIGN: Designed for effortless stroke play, this cricket bat features a lightweight profile that allows for powerful hits and swift bat speed. Ideal for players who enjoy aggressive, high-impact shots and precise placement.", "COMFORTABLE RUBBER GRIP HANDLE: Equipped with a premium rubber grip, the handle provides a secure, anti-slip hold, ensuring enhanced control and minimizing hand strain during extended play. Stay comfortable and confident at the crease.", "PERFECT FOR TENNIS BALL CRICKET: Specially designed to handle the bounce and weight of tennis balls, this bat offers consistent performance and powerful striking ability, making it the perfect companion for casual backyard games, gully cricket, or practice nets.", "IDEAL FOR YOUTH & ADULT PLAYERS : the playR Fluid Kashmir Willow Cricket Bat is suitable for both youth and adult players, offering a versatile option for family matches, local tournaments, and friendly weekend games."],
