    colors: ["Maroon/Gold"],
    sizes: ["3", "4", "5", "6", "FULL"],
    description: "Elevate your game with the playR Armour Kashmir Willow Cricket Bat, expertly crafted to provide the perfect balance of power, control, and durability. Made from premium Kashmir willow, this bat combines traditional craftsmanship with modern design to meet the demands of players at all levels. Its robust construction ensures it can withstand the wear and tear of frequent use, while the superior balance enables smooth handling and swift bat speed for precise shot execution.\n\nThe bat's powerful sweet spot is strategically placed to offer maximum hitting power, helping you score runs with confidence whether you're driving, pulling, or cutting. Designed for all-season play, the playR Armour bat is versatile enough to perform on various pitch types and in different weather conditions, making it a dependable companion for practice sessions and competitive matches alike. Whether you're an amateur cricketer or a seasoned player, this Kashmir willow bat is built to enhance your performance and last for many seasons to come.",
    details: ["Kashmir Willow Construction: Crafted from high-quality Kashmir willow, this bat offers exceptional durability and a classic feel, making it ideal for players who want a traditional yet high-performing cricket bat for various playing conditions.", "Durable and Robust Build: Designed to withstand rigorous use, the playR Armour bat features a tough, reinforced blade and strong edges, ensuring long-lasting performance even during intense matches and practice sessions.", "Superior Balance for Optimal Control: Engineered with precision weight distribution, this bat offers excellent balance, allowing players to have better control and faster bat speed for both defensive strokes and aggressive shots.", "Powerful Sweet Spot: Equipped with a well-positioned, enlarged sweet spot, the bat helps maximize stroke power and accuracy, enabling players to confidently drive the ball with both strength and precision.", "All-Season Versatility: Suitable for a wide range of pitch types and weather conditions, this Kashmir willow bat performs consistently across seasons, making it a reliable choice for players who play year-round cricket."],
