    colors: ["Royal/Silver"],
    sizes: ["3", "5", "6"],
    description: "Get ready to dominate the pitch with the playR Chopper Kashmir Willow Cricket Bat, designed for cricket enthusiasts who crave power, precision, and dependable performance. Crafted from premium quality Kashmir Willow, this bat offers the perfect balance of durability, strength, and playability, making it ideal for casual matches, practice sessions, and street cricket.\n\nThe playR Chopper features a well-balanced lightweight profile that allows for faster bat speed and effortless shot execution. Whether you're launching big hits over the boundary or executing precise defensive strokes, this bat delivers consistent performance and superb control in every game.\n\nEquipped with a comfortable, anti-slip rubber grip, the bat ensures a firm and secure hold, reducing hand fatigue and providing better control during extended play. Designed for use with tennis balls, it's perfect for local tournaments, backyard cricket, and friendly games with family and friends.",
    details: ["KASHMIR WILLOW CONSTRUCTION: Crafted from high-quality Kashmir Willow, the playR Chopper Cricket Bat offers excellent durability, balance, and strength \u2014 making it ideal for casual tennis ball matches, street cricket, and practice sessions.", "LIGHTWEIGHT & EASY SWING DESIGN: Designed for effortless stroke play, this cricket bat features a lightweight profile that allows for powerful hits and swift bat speed. Ideal for players who enjoy aggressive, high-impact shots and precise placement.", "COMFORTABLE RUBBER GRIP HANDLE: Equipped with a premium rubber grip, the handle provides a secure, anti-slip hold, ensuring enhanced control and minimizing hand strain during extended play. Stay comfortable and confident at the crease.", "PERFECT FOR TENNIS BALL CRICKET: Specially designed to handle the bounce and weight of tennis balls, this bat offers consistent performance and powerful striking ability, making it the perfect companion for casual backyard games, gully cricket, or practice nets.", "IDEAL FOR YOUTH & ADULT PLAYERS : playR Chopper Kashmir Willow Cricket Bat is suitable for both youth and adult players, offering a versatile option for family matches, local tournaments, and friendly weekend games."],
