    colors: ["Olive"],
    sizes: ["6 MM"],
    description: "The playR EVA Yoga Mat is crafted for performance, comfort, and convenience. With 6MM thickness, this anti-slip yoga mat offers superior joint protection, grip, and balance for yoga poses, gym workouts, or meditation. Its durable EVA construction makes it easy to clean and ideal for daily use at home, gym, or outdoors. Lightweight, rollable, and stylish \u2013 this yoga mat is made for both men and women who want to elevate their fitness journey. Say goodbye to slipping and discomfort with playR.",
    details: ["Made with Premium EVA Material for Comfort and Durability The playR yoga mat is crafted from high-quality EVA foam, offering a perfect combination of durability and lightweight design. Its 6MM thickness provides exceptional cushioning and comfort, reducing pressure on your knees, elbows, and spine. Whether you're practicing yoga or doing strength training, this mat ensures long-lasting support without compromising on portability.", "Anti-Slip Textured Surface for Maximum Grip and Safety Stay secure and focused during every pose or movement with the mat's anti-slip, textured surface. Designed to provide excellent traction even during sweaty sessions, this mat prevents sliding and shifting on both hard floors and carpeted surfaces. It's ideal for power yoga, pilates, HIIT workouts, and core routines where stability is key.", "Lightweight, Easy to Roll, and Travel-Friendly Design Whether you're working out at home, heading to the gym, or doing yoga in the park, this mat is easy to carry and store. It rolls up quickly and fits comfortably in most gym bags or with a carry strap (not included), making it a great fitness companion for those constantly on the move.", "Moisture-Resistant and Easy to Clean for Everyday Use The sweat-resistant surface repels moisture and stays hygienic even after intense use. Simply wipe it down with a damp cloth or mild soap solution after each session. Its easy maintenance makes it perfect for daily fitness routines, whether you're using it indoors or outdoors.", "Multipurpose Fitness Mat for Yoga, Exercise, Stretching, and More This mat isn't just for yoga\u2014it's perfect for a wide range of activities including pilates, stretching, meditation, floor-based strength training, physiotherapy, mobility drills, and prenatal workouts. Suitable for both beginners and advanced users, the bold royal blue color also adds a sleek, athletic look to your workout gear."],
