    colors: ["Royal Blue"],
    sizes: ["6 MM"],
    description: "Step into your fitness zone with the playR Yoga Mat, crafted for those who seek balance, strength, and comfort in every move. Whether you're a beginner exploring your first yoga flow or a seasoned athlete powering through high-intensity workouts, this yoga mat is built to support your every stretch, pose, and repetition with ease and resilience. With a design that merges function, comfort, and modern minimalism, the playR Yoga Mat is a must-have accessory for home workouts, gym sessions, or on-the-go fitness routines. The 6mm extra thickness provides excellent support for sensitive joints like knees, wrists, and elbows\u2014reducing pressure and improving comfort during long sessions on the floor. Whether you're in Child's Pose or practicing headstands, you'll feel secure, comfortable, and grounded.",
    details: ["Made with EVA Material for Comfort and Durability\nThis yoga mat is crafted from high-quality EVA foam, offering a perfect combination of durability and lightweight design. Its 6MM thickness provides exceptional cushioning and comfort, reducing pressure on your knees, elbows, and spine. Whether you're practicing yoga or doing strength training, this mat ensures long-lasting support without compromising on portability.", "Anti-Slip Textured Surface for Maximum Grip and Safety\nStay secure and focused during every pose or movement with the mat's anti-slip, textured surface. Designed to provide excellent traction even during sweaty sessions, this mat prevents sliding and shifting on both hard floors and carpeted surfaces. It's ideal for power yoga, pilates, HIIT workouts, and core routines where stability is key.", "Lightweight, Easy to Roll, and Travel-Friendly Design\nWhether you're working out at home, heading to the gym, or doing yoga in the park, this mat is easy to carry and store. It rolls up quickly and fits comfortably in most gym bags or with a carry strap (not included), making it a great fitness companion for those constantly on the move.", "Moisture-Resistant and Easy to Clean for Everyday Use\nThe sweat-resistant surface repels moisture and stays hygienic even after intense use. Simply wipe it down with a damp cloth or mild soap solution after each session. Its easy maintenance makes it perfect for daily fitness routines, whether you're using it indoors or outdoors.", "Multipurpose Fitness Mat for Yoga, Exercise, Stretching, and More\nThis mat isn't just for yoga\u2014it's perfect for a wide range of activities including pilates, stretching, meditation, floor-based strength training, physiotherapy, mobility drills, and prenatal workouts. Suitable for both beginners and advanced users, the bold royal blue color also adds a sleek, athletic look to your workout gear."],
