    collections: ["accessories", "adult", "all-products", "chennai-super-kings", "cricket", "drinkware", "home-office", "lifestyle-after-sports", "men", "mug", "playr-x-chennai-super-kings", "unisex", "women"],
    images: ["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/Artboard6.png?v=1782909214"],
    colors: ["Orange"],
    sizes: ["330 ML"],
    placeholder: true,
    description: "playR x CSK Ready to Roar Ceramic Mug \u2013 330ML is a stylish and durable ceramic coffee and tea mug designed for everyday use. Made from high-quality ceramic material, this 330ML mug is perfect for tea, coffee, hot chocolate, and daily beverages. \nIt features bold \u201cReady to Roar\u201d graphics inspired by Chennai Super Kings, making it a great choice for cricket fans and IPL match-day vibes. \nThe smooth finish gives a clean, classy look, while the strong ceramic body makes it suitable for regular use at home, office desks, work-from-home setups, and study tables. This ceramic mug is microwave safe and dishwasher safe, making it easy to clean and convenient for daily routines. Ideal for men and women, it works perfectly as a gifting mug, office mug, home-use coffee cup, IPL fan mug, and all-season daily use mug. Whether it's morning tea, office coffee breaks, or match-day celebrations, this mug fits every moment naturally.",
    details: ["\u2714\ufe0f Superior-Grade Ceramic Mug Build \u2013 Made from high-quality thick ceramic material that offers strong durability, smooth finish, and good heat retention, perfect for daily tea, coffee, and hot beverage use at home, office, or work-from-home setups.", "\u2714\ufe0f 330ML Coffee & Tea Mug Capacity \u2013 Ideal 330ML ceramic coffee mug for tea, coffee, hot chocolate, green tea, and daily drinks. Perfect for office desks, study tables, home kitchens, and everyday routines.", "\u2714\ufe0f Bold CSK Ready to Roar Fan Design \u2013 Specially designed for true Chennai Super Kings fans with bold \u201cReady to Roar\u201d graphics, making it a perfect IPL mug for match days, fan collections, and cricket lovers.", "\u2714\ufe0f Versatile Use for Multiple Occasions \u2013 Whether enjoying a quiet morning alone, celebrating victories with friends, gifting a cricket enthusiast, or hosting an IPL match viewing party, this mug fits every mood and moment beautifully.", "\u2714\ufe0f All-Season Mug for Gifting, Office & Home Use \u2013 Ideal ceramic mug for men and women, suitable for gifting, office use, home use, IPL match days, daily coffee breaks, and all-season beverage use."],
