    details: ["Crafted from High Quality Durable and Lightweight Materials this sipper bottle is built to endure intense gym workouts, outdoor training, and match day activities while maintaining its sleek form, leak proof performance, and long-lasting usability.", "Leak Proof and Secure Flip Top Lid Ensures Hassle Free Hydration carry your protein shakes, energy drinks, or water without the worry of spills, thanks to a tight sealing, ergonomic lid design ideal for training sessions, travel, or cricket practice.", "Generous Capacity with Easy Grip Ergonomic Design thoughtfully engineered to fit into gym bags, cricket kits, and car cup holders, this sipper offers a spacious capacity for daily hydration while remaining compact, lightweight, and comfortable to hold.", "Suitable for All Season Use Whether Indoors or Outdoors its sturdy build and leak proof seal make it perfect for workouts, match days, road trips, office hydration, and sports practice through every season and weather condition.", "Ideal for Protein Supplements, Health Drinks, Smoothies, or Water versatile and multi-functional, this sipper bottle caters to both men and women who prioritize fitness, performance, and hydration, making it an essential part of your active lifestyle gear."],
