    details: ["Officially Licensed Chennai Super Kings Merchandise for Every WhistlePodu Fan: Show your unwavering team spirit with this officially endorsed CSK sipper bottle, designed for fans who roar with pride and whistle loud for their team whether in the stadium, gym, or on-the-go.", "Durable & Lightweight Stainless Steel Construction for Everyday Use: Built from High-quality, rust-resistant stainless steel, this sipper bottle ensures long-lasting durability while maintaining a lightweight, easy-to-carry design \u2014 ideal for daily hydration, workouts, training, or travel.", "Generous 900ML Capacity to Keep You Hydrated Through the Day: With a spacious 900ml capacity, this bottle is perfect for staying refreshed during intense gym sessions, cricket training, or those adrenaline-packed IPL matches where every sip counts.", "Leak-Proof Lid for Mess-Free Convenience in Every Situation: Designed with a secure, tightly sealed lid, this sipper prevents accidental leaks and spills, making it the perfect companion for gym bags, car cup holders, office desks, or stadium seats during those nail-biting Super Kings matches.", "Chennai Super Kings Sipper; CSK Stainless Steel Bottle; WhistlePodu Sipper 900ml; Official CSK Merchandise; CSK Fan Gear; IPL Team Sipper Bottle; Durable Stainless Steel Water Bottle; CSK Hot and Cold Bottle; Leak-Proof Sports Sipper; CSK Gym Bottle; Chennai Super Kings Water Bottle; WhistlePodu Fan Accessories; Sports Sipper for IPL Matches; CSK Stainless Steel Sipper; IPL Cricket Drinkware; CSK Training Bottle; CSK Match Day Sipper; Hot and Cold Water Bottle 900ml; IPL Official Merchandise Bottle"],
