    colors: ["Navy"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "the playR X Chennai Super Kings Regular Track Pants \u2014 your perfect all-season companion for workouts, practice, and match day action. These lightweight, breathable pants are designed for CSK fans who demand comfort, mobility, and performance on and off the field. Crafted from high-performance, quick-dry fabric, they keep sweat away and ensure you stay cool and dry even during intense sessions.\nBuilt with a regular fit, an adjustable drawstring waistband, and deep side pockets, they offer a flexible, comfortable experience with functionality for training and everyday wear. The minimal yet sporty CSK branding adds a bold, authentic fan touch without overwhelming your style. Whether you're training, jogging, or just representing your team in streetwear, these track pants give you the freedom to move \u2014 and the pride to wear yellow with purpose.",
    details: ["Show your team pride with the playR X Chennai Super Kings Regular Track Pants, designed for CSK supporters who train, practice, and live with the energy of champions. Whether you're watching a match or breaking a sweat, these official pants combine athletic performance with bold IPL fan style.", "Lightweight & Breathable for Intense Performance:\nMade from ultra-lightweight and breathable fabric, these track pants offer a cool and dry experience during rigorous workouts, matches, or casual wear. The material's quick-dry nature helps regulate temperature while wicking away sweat, so you stay comfortable from warm-up to wind-down.", "All-Season Comfort \u2013 Perfect for Any Weather or Workout:\nWhether it's summer training or winter gym sessions, the all-season versatility of these pants makes them a reliable choice year-round. With moisture-wicking properties and just the right weight, they adapt to your activity and climate effortlessly.", "Functional Design with Athletic Fit:\nThese regular-fit track pants offer ample room for movement while maintaining a streamlined athletic look. Designed with elastic waistband, adjustable drawstrings, and deep side pockets, they offer both performance and practicality during any activity.", "Versatile Style \u2013 From Field to Street:\nIdeal for training, match day warmups, gym workouts, or even lounging, the CSK track pants are designed to fit into your routine, whatever your pace. Pair them with jerseys, tees, or hoodies to create your ultimate CSK fan-athlete look."],
