    details: ["The playR x Csk Training Shorts are built to handle everything from high-intensity training to laid-back lounging. Designed for hybrid versatility, these regular-fit shorts are equally suited for gym workouts, outdoor training, daily commutes, or casual weekend wear.", "Lightweight & Breathable for All-Day Comfort:\nMade with lightweight, breathable fabric, these shorts promote maximum airflow and ventilation to keep you cool and dry even during the sweatiest sessions. Whether you're lifting weights or walking the streets, the moisture-wicking material ensures all-day comfort.", "egular Fit with Smart Construction for Easy Movement:\nThe ergonomic, regular fit ensures ease of movement while still offering a sharp, structured look. Built for flexibility and comfort, these shorts feature a non-restrictive waistband, adjustable drawcord, and relaxed thigh space\u2014so you're free to move with purpose and confidence.", "Designed with functional side pockets and subtle detailing, the Hybrid Shorts offer storage for small essentials without bulk. The clean, modern silhouette blends seamlessly into both fitness and streetwear wardrobes, giving you the ultimate mix of function and fashion.", "Everyday Essential \u2013 Built for All Seasons & Occasions:\nWhether you're heading to the gym, lounging at home, or stepping out for casual plans, these all-season shorts are your reliable bottomwear essential. Durable, soft, and low-maintenance, they are made to match the pace of your active, modern lifestyle."],
