    colors: ["Navy/Royal/Yellow"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL"],
    description: "Train like a pro, lounge like a fan, and move like a champion with the playR x CSK Jog Shorts \u2013 the ultimate fan-inspired activewear. Made for CSK supporters who live the game, these shorts combine athletic comfort with official IPL style. The lightweight, breathable fabric keeps you cool and dry whether you're lifting at the gym, jogging outdoors, or kicking back post-workout.\nDesigned with a regular fit, adjustable waistband, and functional pockets, the shorts offer freedom of movement and everyday utility. The moisture-wicking fabric ensures dryness through intense activity, while the subtle CSK branding adds just the right touch of fan pride. From fitness routines to match day streetwear, these jog shorts are built for all-season versatility\u2014making them your go-to bottomwear for performance, style, and team spirit.",
    details: ["Official CSK Jog Shorts \u2013 For True Fans Who Train:\nStep into performance and pride with the playR x Chennai Super Kings Jog Shorts, designed for CSK supporters who bring their champion mindset to every workout. With bold yet minimal CSK branding, these shorts are the perfect blend of fanwear and functionality\u2014whether you're training, relaxing, or cheering for the Yellow Army.", "Lightweight & Breathable Fabric \u2013 Engineered for Comfort:\nCrafted from lightweight, breathable materials, these jog shorts deliver all-day comfort and airflow during intense gym sessions, cardio runs, or just lounging. The moisture-wicking fabric quickly pulls sweat away from your skin, keeping you dry and focused through every rep, round, and rally.", "Ergonomic Regular Fit \u2013 Designed for Movement:\nThe adjustable drawstring waistband ensures a customized fit, while the flexible fabric moves with your body\u2014perfect for squats, sprints, or casual strolls.", "Utility Meets Minimal Style \u2013 With Handy Pockets:\nBuilt for real life, these jog shorts come with deep side pockets for carrying essentials like keys, phone, or earbuds. The clean, tapered finish and CSK detailing give them a polished sporty look that pairs effortlessly with tees, jerseys, or hoodies for an everyday fan-athlete vibe.", "All-Season Versatility \u2013 From Gym to Street:\nPerfect for training, gym, match day prep, or laid-back weekends, the playR x CSK Jog Shorts are made to handle it all. Their durable yet soft construction makes them ideal for year-round wear\u2014your new favorite bottomwear for both active and casual occasions."],
