    colors: ["Yellow/Blue"],
    sizes: ["2XL", "L", "M", "S", "XL", "XS"],
    description: "Elevate your training and show off your Chennai Super Kings pride with the playR x CSK Training Singlet 2026 \u2013 a lightweight, breathable, and officially licensed sleeveless tee designed for active fans. Perfect for workouts, cricket practice, or casual summer wear, this singlet combines comfort, style, and team spirit in one versatile top.\n\nCrafted from high-quality polyester, it wicks away sweat, keeping you cool and dry during intense sessions. The regular fit and sleeveless design provide unrestricted movement, making it ideal for sports, outdoor drills, or simply enjoying match-day activities in comfort.\n\nSubtle CSK graphics and authentic branding give it a sleek, sporty look that pairs easily with joggers, shorts, or casual wear. Reinforced stitching and fade-resistant colors ensure long-lasting durability, making it a reliable choice for everyday training or fanwear. This singlet is the perfect blend of performance, style, and team loyalty for every Chennai Super Kings supporter.",
    details: ["\u2714\ufe0f Official CSK Training Singlet IPL 2026 \u2013 Lightweight & Sporty \u2013 Showcase your dedication to the Chennai Super Kings during workouts, outdoor sessions, or casual outings with this official playR x CSK Training Singlet. Featuring authentic CSK branding and a bold athletic design, it's the perfect sleeveless tee for high-performance fanwear.", "\u2714\ufe0f Breathable Fabric for Intense Training \u2013 Crafted from lightweight, quick-drying polyester fabric, this singlet offers excellent breathability and sweat-wicking comfort. Whether you're hitting the gym, training outdoors, or going for a run, this sleeveless design helps regulate body temperature and keep you cool.", "\u2714\ufe0f Regular Fit with Freedom of Movement \u2013 Designed with a comfortable regular fit, the unisex silhouette allows full range of motion and ensures zero distractions during physical activity. Ideal for training, field practice, or everyday wear in warm weather.", "\u2714\ufe0f Minimalist Style \u2013 Featuring subtle yet striking CSK graphics on the chest and back, this singlet lets you show your team pride in a sleek, modern way. The minimal design makes it easy to pair with joggers, shorts, or even casual denims.", "\u2714\ufe0f Durable, All-Season Performance Wear \u2013 Made with reinforced seams and fade-resistant colors, this training singlet is built for repeated use. Its soft-touch finish and functional design make it a go-to top for all-season workouts or relaxed fanwear."],
