    colors: ["Blue"],
    sizes: ["One Size"],
    soldOut: true,
    description: "Gear up like a true Super Kings fan with the CSK Kitbag\u2014a high-performance sports essential crafted for serious cricketers and devoted fans alike. Designed in collaboration with Chennai Super Kings, this lightweight yet highly durable cricket kit bag is engineered to keep your gear secure, organized, and ready for action\u2014whether it's practice, match day, or travel.\nMade from High Quality material, this kitbag can endure rough usage, unpredictable weather, and intense training schedules. The multiple spacious compartments\u2014allow you to separate and organize all your cricket essentials with ease. The smooth-glide zippers, padded shoulder straps, and reinforced handles ensure carrying comfort and long-term reliability.\nFinished with bold CSK branding, this stylish yellow-black bag reflects your team spirit while delivering peak functionality. From the nets to the tournament and everything in between, the playR x CSK Kitbag is the ultimate all-season companion for cricketers who mean business and fans who live the game.",
    details: ["\u2714\ufe0f Official Chennai Super Kings Kitbag \u2013 Official CSK fan gear with bold team branding, iconic CSK logo, and signature team colors. Designed for both fans and players, it's perfect for training, travel, and match days\u2014a practical sports kitbag and stylish CSK supporter accessory in one.", "\u2714\ufe0f Heavy-Duty & Water-Resistant Construction \u2013 Made from strong, water-resistant material to handle tough practice sessions, travel, and outdoor use. Keeps your gear safe and dry, making it a reliable sports kitbag for training, matches, and daily carry.", "\u2714\ufe0f Multiple Compartments for Organized Storage \u2013 Designed with dedicated sections for bat, shoes, clothing, accessories, and valuables. Keeps all your cricket gear neatly organized, making it a practical, clutter-free sports kitbag for training, matches, and travel.", "\u2714\ufe0f Ergonomic & Travel-Friendly Design \u2013 Adjustable padded shoulder straps, strong carry handles, and reinforced stitching for easy carrying and long-lasting use. Comfortable for daily use and travel, making it a reliable sports kitbag for practice, matches, and trips.", "\u2714\ufe0f Versatile All-Season & Multi-Sport Use \u2013 Designed for cricket but perfect for gym, fitness training, travel, and other sports. Strong build and smart design make it a reliable all-purpose kitbag for year-round use and daily activities."],
