    details: ["High-Quality Leather Construction for Tournament Play: This Tournament Leather Cricket Ball is meticulously crafted using High-grade leather, ensuring exceptional durability, shape retention, and consistent performance over extended play. Ideal for both professional matches and club tournaments, it's built to withstand the intensity of competitive cricket.", "Optimized for 35-40 Overs of Consistent Performance: Specially designed to maintain its shape, seam, and shine for 35 to 40 overs, this leather ball delivers reliable bounce, swing, and seam movement, making it the preferred choice for serious cricketers seeking long-lasting match-grade equipment.", "High-Visibility Red Finish: The vibrant Red coating ensures excellent visibility in different lighting conditions, including daytime play and under powerful stadium floodlights, allowing players to track the ball effortlessly during fast-paced action.", "Hand-Stitched Seam for Enhanced Swing and Grip: The ball features a precisely hand-stitched seam using high-tensile threads, providing superior grip for bowlers and optimal seam presentation for both swing and spin. Its polished red leather surface enhances visibility and maintains professional aesthetics throughout play.", "Perfect for Club Matches, Tournament Fixtures, and Intense Training Sessions: Whether you're preparing for a high-stakes club tournament or honing your skills in extended net sessions, this ball offers outstanding balance, control, and match-day reliability, making it an essential addition to any cricket kit."],
