    images: ["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/PRSRH25-FANCAP-21.jpg?v=1756795702", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/2_964a2d67-fa4f-429e-badf-3bc6b7fd0f34.jpg?v=1756795702", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/3_c9aec8ed-8383-4728-9c60-86a83dad0c47.jpg?v=1756795702", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/4_0c658f30-680e-4d10-a190-3236a6e37179.jpg?v=1756795702", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/5_59ebaca1-a1c5-48f7-8f3c-4879cc8412f7.jpg?v=1756795702", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0679/5939/0427/files/6_655e414e-0047-454b-ba34-515c996c742b.jpg?v=1756795702"],
    colors: ["Black"],
    sizes: ["One Size"],
    description: "Show your team pride in comfort and style with the Sunrisers Hyderabad Authentic Fan Cap, designed for dedicated SRH supporters who value everyday wearability and performance. Made from a cotton poly fabric blend, this lightweight cricket fan cap offers soft comfort, breathable support, and durable structure\u2014perfect for long match days, summer outings, and active lifestyles. The cotton poly material provides a balanced feel of softness and strength, making it an ideal cricket sports cap for men and women.\n\nThe adjustable closure at the back ensures a secure and customizable fit for all-day comfort. Designed as a unisex IPL fan cap, it works perfectly as a stadium cap, gym cap, outdoor sports cap, or everyday casual accessory. Durable stitching and high-quality cotton poly fabric help maintain shape and color even after regular use.\n\nPerfect for IPL match day, stadium wear, outdoor activities, gym sessions, training, travel, and casual outings, this SRH cricket fan cap is a must-have addition to your Sunrisers Hyderabad merchandise collection. A versatile sports cap built for all-season comfort and true cricket fans.",
