    details: ["High-Performance Fabric for Active Lifestyles: Crafted from lightweight, sweat-wicking polyester, this playR unisex jersey ensures superior breathability, keeping you cool and dry during intense training sessions, outdoor sports, or gym workouts.", "Stylish & Sporty Orange Design for All Genders: The vibrant orange color makes a bold statement on the field or off it, while the unisex cut ensures a flattering regular fit \u2014perfect for teams, clubs, and fans alike.", "Ideal for Multi-Sport Use and Everyday Wear: Whether you're playing cricket, football, hitting the gym, jogging, or simply embracing sporty streetwear, this versatile jersey combines comfort with a dynamic athletic look that transitions from sport to casual.", "Durable Stitching & Fade-Resistant Colors: Built for performance and longevity, the jersey features double-stitched seams and high-quality colorfast fabric that retains its vivid look even after multiple washes and extended use.", "Comfortable Medium Fit with Full Range of Motion: The regular fit is tailored for movement, ensuring ease of motion in the shoulders, arms, and torso\u2014great for competitive sports, group uniforms, or fitness activities requiring flexibility and endurance."],
